    {
      "bbox": [
        227,
        371,
        1858,
        700
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Mayor Robert F. Wagner today moved to establish a blood credit program to provide blood for the city's 250,000 employees and their immediate families. He named a three member board to work out the procedures.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.4229,
          "min": -1.8058
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 46,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0089
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12858,
        "area_px": 522504,
        "density": 0.02461,
        "chars": 208,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.18
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        227,
        745,
        1900,
        974
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The program will also help in maintaining an adequate supply of blood for other civilian needs and for the requirements of the armed services.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3486,
          "min": -1.7981
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 25,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0028
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4741,
        "area_px": 364797,
        "density": 0.013,
        "chars": 142,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 29.95
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        227,
        1021,
        1945,
        1347
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Named to the new board are Dr. Leona Baumgartner, Commissioner of Health; Dr. Theodore H. Lang, Chairman of the City Civil Service Commission and City Personnel Director; and Dr. Ray Trussell, Commissioner of Hospitals. Dr. Lang will serve as Chairman.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2729,
          "min": -1.612
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 57,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0086
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2936,
        "area_px": 517725,
        "density": 0.00567,
        "chars": 252,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 85.83
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        227,
        1385,
        1915,
        1707
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Mayor directed the new board to study all of the problems which would confront the city in establishing and maintaining a program to supply a sufficient amount of blood to meet the needs of approximately three-quarters of a million persons.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.271,
          "min": -1.646
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 43,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0131
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9205,
        "area_px": 511353,
        "density": 0.018,
        "chars": 244,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 26.51
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        235,
        1745,
        1863,
        2064
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Some of the problems the board has to consider involve the collection of blood from city employees, a determination of the basis on which blood is to be provided, and how to establish blood credit for city employees.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3218,
          "min": -1.8168
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11622,
